#: src/foreword.md:1
msgid "Foreword"
msgstr "序言"

#: src/foreword.md:3
msgid ""
"The Rust programming language has come a long way in a few short years, from "
"its creation and incubation by a small and nascent community of enthusiasts, "
"to becoming one of the most loved and in-demand programming languages in the "
"world. Looking back, it was inevitable that the power and promise of Rust "
"would turn heads and gain a foothold in systems programming. What was not "
"inevitable was the global growth in interest and innovation that permeated "
"through open source communities and catalyzed wide-scale adoption across "
"industries."
msgstr ""
"Rust 程式語言在短短幾年內走了很長一段路，從由小而新興的熱情社群孕育與孵化開"
"始，成長為全球最受喜愛且需求最高的程式語言之一。回顧過去，Rust 的力量與承諾引"
"人注目並在系統程式設計中站穩腳步是必然的。並非必然的是，開源社群中迅速擴散的"
"全球性興趣與創新，進而催化跨產業的大規模採用。"

#: src/foreword.md:11
msgid ""
"At this point in time, it is easy to point to the wonderful features that "
"Rust has to offer to explain this explosion in interest and adoption. Who "
"doesn’t want memory safety, _and_ fast performance, _and_ a friendly "
"compiler, _and_ great tooling, among a host of other wonderful features? The "
"Rust language you see today combines years of research in systems "
"programming with the practical wisdom of a vibrant and passionate community. "
"This language was designed with purpose and crafted with care, offering "
"developers a tool that makes it easier to write safe, fast, and reliable "
"code."
msgstr ""
"到了現在，要用 Rust 所提供的精彩特性來解釋這波興趣與採用的爆發是很容易的。誰"
"不想要記憶體安全、_又_ 有高效能、_又_ 有友善的編譯器、_又_ 有優秀的工具等眾多"
"優點呢？你今天看到的 Rust，結合了多年的系統程式設計研究與充滿活力且熱情的社群"
"所累積的實務智慧。這門語言以明確的目的設計、並以細心打造，為開發者提供一個更"
"容易撰寫安全、快速且可靠程式碼的工具。"

#: src/foreword.md:20
msgid ""
"But what makes Rust truly special is its roots in empowering you, the user, "
"to achieve your goals. This is a language that wants you to succeed, and the "
"principle of empowerment runs through the core of the community that builds, "
"maintains, and advocates for this language. Since the previous edition of "
"this definitive text, Rust has further developed into a truly global and "
"trusted language. The Rust Project is now robustly supported by the Rust "
"Foundation, which also invests in key initiatives to ensure that Rust is "
"secure, stable, and sustainable."
msgstr ""
"但真正讓 Rust 特別的是，它根植於賦能使用者、幫助你達成目標。這是一門希望你成"
"功的語言，而賦能的理念貫穿於建構、維護並推廣這門語言的社群核心。自前一版權威"
"文本以來，Rust 進一步發展為真正全球化且值得信賴的語言。Rust 專案如今由 Rust "
"基金會穩健支持，並投資關鍵計畫以確保 Rust 的安全、穩定與永續。"

#: src/foreword.md:29
msgid ""
"This edition of _The Rust Programming Language_ is a comprehensive update, "
"reflecting the language’s evolution over the years and providing valuable "
"new information. But it is not just a guide to syntax and libraries—it’s an "
"invitation to join a community that values quality, performance, and "
"thoughtful design. Whether you’re a seasoned developer looking to explore "
"Rust for the first time or an experienced Rustacean looking to refine your "
"skills, this edition offers something for everyone."
msgstr ""
"《_The Rust Programming Language_》的這個版次是一個全面更新，反映了語言多年來"
"的演進，並提供有價值的新資訊。但它不只是語法與函式庫的指南——它也是一張邀請"
"函，邀請你加入重視品質、效能與深思熟慮設計的社群。無論你是想第一次探索 Rust "
"的資深開發者，或是希望精進技能的資深 Rustacean，這個版次都能提供你需要的內"
"容。"

#: src/foreword.md:37
msgid ""
"The Rust journey has been one of collaboration, learning, and iteration. The "
"growth of the language and its ecosystem is a direct reflection of the "
"vibrant, diverse community behind it. The contributions of thousands of "
"developers, from core language designers to casual contributors, are what "
"make Rust such a unique and powerful tool. By picking up this book, you’re "
"not just learning a new programming language—you’re joining a movement to "
"make software better, safer, and more enjoyable to work with."
msgstr ""
"Rust 的旅程是一段協作、學習與反覆精進的歷程。這門語言與其生態系的成長，正是背"
"後充滿活力且多元社群的直接映照。從核心語言設計者到一般貢獻者，數千位開發者的"
"投入，造就了 Rust 如此獨特且強大的工具。拿起這本書，你不只是學習一門新的程式"
"語言——你也加入了一場讓軟體更好、更安全、且更令人樂於投入的運動。"

#: src/foreword.md:45
msgid "Welcome to the Rust community!"
msgstr "歡迎加入 Rust 社群！"

#: src/foreword.md:47
msgid "Bec Rumbul, Executive Director of the Rust Foundation"
msgstr "Bec Rumbul，Rust Foundation 執行董事"
